AeroSpace and Defence Industries Association of Europe. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by ASD. It applies rule categories
described in public documentation about the standard. It does not reproduce the
standard's text or its approved-word dictionary. The official standard is a free
download at https://www.asd-ste100.org/

This project is not a medical or diagnostic tool. It shapes text output. It does
not assess, diagnose, or treat any condition.
